   "text": "Universidad Europea Madrid - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversidad Europea Madrid\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nUniversidad Europea considers academic excellence as one of its strategic pillars. Thus, our educational model has endorsed the principles of the European Higher Education Area based on the holistic learning of the person. In this model, the teacher is a reference and also a counselor who accompanies the student throughout his university life. The student, on the other hand, traces his own formative path developing the knowledge, competences, skills and values demanded by today's society. Our model places special emphasis on the maturity and autonomy of the student, so that he learns to adapt to an increasingly complex and perpetually changing world.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n02/04/2026 11:29\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n02/04/2026 11:29\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nSpain\nYearly Fees\nMax: €23,000.00\nMin: €8,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n40%\n12,000 of 30,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1995\nCampus(es)\nMadrid, Valencia, Canarias\nCountry\nSpain\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/01/2023\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://universidadeuropea.com/en/study-ue/campus-life/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://universidadeuropea.com/en/admission-finance/scholarship-financial-aid/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H9b7uPSMhHI\nInternship Details\nhttps://universidadeuropea.com/en/study-ue/internships/\nAdditional Information\n-",
